# Search keywords for guide entries, including pages outside the Frontier prototype folder.
# Keys use nf-guidebook-search-keywords- followed by the guideEntry prototype ID in lowercase.
# Separate alternative names, abbreviations, and keyword phrases with semicolons.
# Entry titles are always searchable automatically. These terms add other ways to find a page.
# Keep phrases specific to the page so searches stay relevant.

